  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "p1",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "In the course of human history there have been many great minds who have contributed to the "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "fields",
      "ref": "v-field"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " of science, math, literature and more. "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b1",
      "number": 1
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " them, my favourite is a woman scientist: Marie Curie."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Marie was born on November 7, 1867. Her parents were both educators. Marie’s mother was a "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "principal",
      "ref": "v-principal"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " and her father taught science in the school. But life at that time was very hard. Marie’s mother and sister died from "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b2",
      "number": 2
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " for which there were no "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "cures",
      "ref": "v-cure"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "When Marie was old enough, she found a job and waited for a chance to "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b3",
      "number": 3
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " higher education. "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b4",
      "number": 4
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ", she was able to "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "enrol",
      "ref": "v-enrol"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " in a college in Paris and studied math and science there."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "While in college, she met a man named Pierre. Pierre also showed a(an) "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b5",
      "number": 5
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " in science. They married and did experiments in a lab with only simple equipment. After some time, they found a new "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "element",
      "ref": "v-element"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " they named "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "Radium",
      "zh": "镭"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". Years later, their "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b6",
      "number": 6
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " was "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "approved",
      "ref": "v-approve"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " by the government, and they won the Nobel Prize!"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p5",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "The couple were so excited. When Marie was standing on the stage "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b7",
      "number": 7
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " her award, she said: “The discovery of Radium "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b8",
      "number": 8
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " all of us, not just me.”"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p6",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "The fact that a woman could contribute to science and "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "persist",
      "ref": "v-persist"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " in her experiments to achieve such great success "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b9",
      "number": 9
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " me. She was also very "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "humble",
      "ref": "v-humble"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " by stating that her invention was everyone’s and not just her own. Marie was a clever and persistent woman who set a good "
     },
     {
      "t": "blank",
      "id": "b10",
      "number": 10
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " for future generations."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
